{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.1-2016-000037", "doc_id": "GBT33170.1-2016", "statement": "GB/T 33170.1 2016评估人员评估组长：***签字评估组成员：***签字***签字*****水签字***签字报告编制人：***签字***报告审核人：***签字技术专家（列出各类技术专家名单）", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": [], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.1-2016@sec-0050", "pdf_page": 12, "printed_page": "9", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
